        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Sean is correct on this issue.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "This ongoing spending should be frozen before being reduced.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Kevin McCarthy has the ability to influence future spending decisions.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Additional spending should not become permanent.",
