      },
      {
        "text": "National debt is the greatest threat to U.S. national security.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Government efficiency improvements are necessary to manage salaries.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Zero-based budgeting should replace baseline budgeting.",
