    "turn_text": "And the United States has always said that they would be positioned to help defend Taiwan. That is why it is so important. that we conduct military sales to Taiwan right now so that they have what they need to defend themselves. And before Putin went into Ukraine, I sent a letter over to the White House now. It's the time for sales to Ukraine because you could see that Putin was amassing troops and equipment on the border. It is imperative that our allies knows that they are our allies and that our enemies knows that they are our enemies.",
